flowchart LR
    Q[Question] --> G1[Input guardrails]
    G1 --> Cd[Condense follow-up]
    Cd --> Tf[Rewrite / multi-query / HyDE]
    Tf --> Rt["Retrieve<br/>(access-filtered)"]
    Rt --> Fu[Fuse results]
    Fu --> Rr[Rerank]
    Rr --> Pa[Expand to parent section]
    Pa --> G2[Context guardrails]
    G2 --> Ab{Enough grounding?}
    Ab -- no --> Dec[Decline, with a reason]
    Ab -- yes --> An[Answer + verified citations]
    An --> Vf[Answer verification]
    Vf --> G3[Output guardrails]
    G3 --> Out[Final answer]
